{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121167","id":4029854456,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7wMrL4","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121167","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121167.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121167.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121167","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121167/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121167/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121167/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e7bccb92e476e23c177a6b59c526f70408c81dbf","number":121167,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Improve HSlider and VSlider styling","user":{"login":"MileyHollenberg","id":799917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5OTkxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/799917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg","html_url":"https://github.com/MileyHollenberg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n* Added extra styling options to the `HSlider` and `VSlider` whilst gracefully falling back to the original styling options.\r\n* Added a new color field, `grabber_color`, which modulates the grabber icons.\r\n* Fixed an issue where the documentation wasn't showing up for the already existing styling options due to the usage of `BIND_THEME_ITEM_CUSTOM` over `BIND_THEME_ITEM` by renaming the fields (not a breaking change as it was only the local name in the `theme_cache` of the sliders)\r\n* Updated the Theme Preview to add a disabled `VSlider` and set both it and the disabled `HSlider`'s value to 50% so it's easier to see both sides of it whilst setting up your theme.\r\n\r\nThis PR is similar to both #120766 and #120879 with the main difference being that the hover state is instead called `highlight` here. This was already the case for the Slider class and wouldn't be worth a breaking change if I were to rename it to `hover` instead.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/72efd369-53ab-4a17-a987-d0e7d7b2180f\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fbbb35f0-5192-4451-8d57-dedea21a6525\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nHere's the test project I used during this, [guitest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29891746/guitest.zip), which includes the textures for the HSlider and VSlider and their new states.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos